Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197CE9::
# 39 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "The thought that I’m getting closer to\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE...\pI’m getting stage fright...$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197D42::
# 43 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "I couldn’t do a thing...$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197D5B::
# 47 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "The POKéMON LEAGUE became distant\nagain... What a letdown...$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197D98::
# 51 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "To win your way through the POKéMON\nLEAGUE, you need the trust of your\lPOKéMON.$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197DE8::
# 55 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "Your relationship is based on\nsolid trust.$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197E13::
# 59 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "By being together all the time, trust\ngrows between POKéMON and TRAINERS.$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197E5D::
# 63 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "This isn’t the goal. It’s only a place\non the way to the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197EA6::
# 67 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "That’s the way!$"

Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44_Text_08197EB6::
# 71 "data/maps/Naranja_VictoryRoad_G24_M44/scripts.pory"
	.string "You’ll do fine, for sure!\nYour POKéMON are all eager to go!$"
